  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norway India Partnetship Initiative Phase III (NIPI III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIPI III will support the Indian Minsitry of Health and Family Welfare (MoHFW) in implementing its intensification plan for improved maternal and child health outcomes in 102 districts in 9 states in India. It will also assist the MoHFW in establishing an innovation hub, or think tank, that will identify and test promising healthcare innovations in the field of maternal and child health; and it will assist the Government of India to document best practices from NIPI for global dissemination.</narrative>
  </description>
